### Obtiene todas las rutinas
GET http://localhost:5152/api/routines
Accept: application/json

### Obtiene rutina con el ID
GET http://localhost:5152/api/routines/1
Accept: application/json

### Crea una rutina
POST http://localhost:5152/api/routines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Spinning 30 min"
}

### Actualiza una rutina
PUT http://localhost:5152/api/routines/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Cardio Quemagrasa 45 min"
}

### Elimina una rutina
DELETE http://localhost:5152/api/routines/2